Bounded host codec compatibility layers:
The GamePKG-owned crates under compat/image, compat/zstd, compat/deflate,
compat/gzip and compat/zip wrap reviewed upstream codec implementations with
explicit input and output caps. They are host dependencies only. Games cannot
declare, import or link them; guests continue to use host-owned image, asset
and archive services. Upstream licenses are retained in the vendored sources
and third-party notices.

Other Rust dependencies retain the license texts shipped with their published
crates. No dependency becomes a guest crate permission.
